  "description": {
   "en": "Abandoned by her parents, Mebachi Higashigumo is mistreated by her foster parents. Then one day, she is suddenly attacked by a \"vampire,\" a demon that lurks in this world. She recalls the days of oppression and almost gives up on life, but at that moment, she is attacked by a vampire, a demon that lurks in this world! \"I will change you. I will change you, and in return, I want your lifeblood!\" Another vampire offers him a \"blood contract\"!?",
   "ja": "親に捨てられた少女・東雲めばちは里親に虐げられる毎日。そんなある日、この世界に潜む鬼“吸血鬼”に突如襲われる。抑圧された日々を思い返し、生きることを諦めかけた、その瞬間！「俺がお前を変えてやる。その代わりお前の生き血くれ。」別の吸血鬼が、“血の契約”を持ちかけてきてーー!?"
  },
